life goes on.

722
01:03:36.886 --> 01:03:36.925
Marvin Decker Anderson,
US Army.

723
01:03:36.928 --> 01:03:40.680
Marvin Decker Anderson,
US Army.

724
01:03:42.392 --> 01:03:45.977
Juan Raymondo Benitez,
US Army.

725
01:03:47.980 --> 01:03:51.231
Pryce Marshall Benson,
US Marines.

726
01:03:55.738 --> 01:03:59.866
Cassius Marcellus Clay,
US Army.

727
01:04:11.088 --> 01:04:12.879
Mr. Clay,
I'm required to inform you...

728
01:04:12.964 --> 01:04:15.923
that refusal to accept
a lawful induction order...

729
01:04:16.719 --> 01:04:18.928
constitutes a felony...

730
01:04:19.014 --> 01:04:22.724
under the Universal Military
Training and Service Act...

731
01:04:22.766 --> 01:04:26.852
punishable by
five years imprisonment...

732
01:04:26.938 --> 01:04:29.772
and a $10,000 fine.

733
01:04:29.858 --> 01:04:31.441
Do you understand?

734
01:04:32.026 --> 01:04:34.401
Yes, sir.

735
01:04:54.134 --> 01:04:56.885
Federal Bureau of Investigation.

736
01:04:56.971 --> 01:04:59.805
Mr. Clay, you're under arrest
for refusing induction.

737
01:05:37.887 --> 01:05:39.929
Yeah.

738
01:05:40.015 --> 01:05:42.224
Yeah, this is me.

739
01:05:42.309 --> 01:05:46.019
No, you got to ask Chauncey Eskridge.
That's my lawyer. He's in Chicago.

740
01:05:47.857 --> 01:05:49.774
No, I'm out on bail.

741
01:05:51.860 --> 01:05:55.237
No, man, I ain't never
shot nothin' in my life.

742
01:05:55.322 --> 01:05:59.241
No ducks, no geese,
no deer, no nothin'.

743
01:05:59.327 --> 01:06:02.954
Yeah, I know where Vietnam is.
It's on TV.

744
01:06:04.499 --> 01:06:08.293
Southeast Asia?
What, it's there too?

745
01:06:12.257 --> 01:06:14.424
What do I think about who?

746
01:06:14.509 --> 01:06:16.050
The Vietcong?

747
01:06:18.388 --> 01:06:21.556
Man, I ain't got no quarrel
with them Vietcong.

748
01:06:23.186 --> 01:06:26.479
Ain't no Vietcong
ever called me nigger.

749
01:06:27.439 --> 01:06:29.481
Yeah, that's right.

750
01:06:34.447 --> 01:06:37.114
You know what you're doin', Ali?

751
01:06:38.410 --> 01:06:40.201
You know what you just said?

752
01:06:40.871 --> 01:06:42.913
Everyone, Europe to China,
every home in America...

753
01:06:42.999 --> 01:06:45.041
everyone’s gonna know what the
heavyweight champion of the world...

754
01:06:45.084 --> 01:06:47.209
said about the US war.

755
01:06:49.004 --> 01:06:52.005
So what? So what?
I ain't got to be...

756
01:06:52.091 --> 01:06:54.049
what nobody else
want me to be...

757
01:06:54.093 --> 01:06:56.760
and I ain't afraid to be
what I wanna be...

758
01:06:56.846 --> 01:06:58.846
think how I wanna think.

759
01:07:17.785 --> 01:07:20.786
I got almost nowhere I can
promote a fight for you.

760
01:07:20.872 --> 01:07:23.289
Plus I think they're gonna
vacate you from the crown.

761
01:07:23.373 --> 01:07:25.623
- What?
- Yeah, if you're convicted.

762
01:07:27.295 --> 01:07:30.505
Oh, so they're gonna take from me
what no fighter in the world can.

763
01:07:30.589 --> 01:07:32.547
And New York may revoke
your boxing license.

764
01:07:32.633 --> 01:07:35.592
You sure you wanna do this?

765
01:07:35.679 --> 01:07:38.764
The next three to four years
are every heavyweight's prime.

766
01:07:38.849 --> 01:07:41.725
There are few of those years.

767
01:07:44.479 --> 01:07:47.605
- What about Terrell?
- We'll know about that this afternoon.

768
01:07:47.650 --> 01:07:50.943
I gotta find us some venues fast.
I'll call you later.

769
01:07:55.575 --> 01:08:01.121
You understand the issue is your
license to fight Terrell in Illinois?

770
01:08:01.205 --> 01:08:02.788
Yes.

771
01:08:02.874 --> 01:08:05.124
Then are you prepared
to apologize...

772
01:08:05.210 --> 01:08:07.919
about your unpatriotic remarks
about the war?

773
01:08:17.347 --> 01:08:20.014
- You say you're the people's champion.
- Yes, sir.

774
01:08:20.100 --> 01:08:22.601
Do you think you're acting
like the people's champion?

775
01:08:22.687 --> 01:08:25.730
Yes, sir.
I'm not gonna apologize to you.

776
01:08:25.814 --> 01:08:29.357
This is not a courtroom, and I do not
have to answer your questions.

777
01:08:38.286 --> 01:08:41.162
- What about Terrell?
- We'll fight in another state!

778
01:08:41.206 --> 01:08:43.623
- Are you gonna dodge the draft?
- I ain't draft-dodgin'...

779
01:08:43.708 --> 01:08:46.167
I ain't burnin' no flag,
and I ain't runnin' to Canada.

780
01:08:46.253 --> 01:08:49.212
I'm stayin' right here.
You wanna send me to jail?

781
01:08:49.298 --> 01:08:51.590
Fine. You go right ahead.
I've been in jail for 400 years.

782
01:08:51.674 --> 01:08:53.591
I can be there
for four or five more.

783
01:08:53.677 --> 01:08:55.594
But I ain't going'
no 10,000 miles...

784
01:08:55.679 --> 01:08:58.180
to help murder and kill
other poor people.

785
01:08:58.266 --> 01:09:02.560
If I wanna die, I'll die right here
right now, fightin' you, if I wanna die.

786
01:09:02.645 --> 01:09:06.564
You my enemy. Not no Chinese,
no Vietcong, no Japanese.

787
01:09:06.650 --> 01:09:08.692
You my opposer
when I want freedom.

788
01:09:08.775 --> 01:09:12.485
You my opposer when I want justice.
You my opposer when I want equality.

789
01:09:12.572 --> 01:09:14.280
You want me to go somewhere
and fight for you.

790
01:09:14.366 --> 01:09:16.366
You won't even stand up for me
right here in America...

791
01:09:16.410 --> 01:09:18.368
for my rights
and my religious beliefs.

792
01:09:18.411 --> 01:09:20.745
You won't even stand up for me
right here at home.

793
01:09:23.250 --> 01:09:25.333
- Which guy you want to go first?
- You, sir.

794
01:09:25.420 --> 01:09:28.379
Tell Clay he gettin' on after me.
I'm the champ.

795
01:09:28.421 --> 01:09:31.297
- What?
- I said you can get on after me.

796
01:09:31.383 --> 01:09:34.050
- No. What'd you call me?
- I called you Clay.

797
01:09:34.137 --> 01:09:36.721
You will announce it from right here,
from flat on your back.

798
01:09:36.764 --> 01:09:38.806
What's my name?
What's my name?

799
01:09:40.685 --> 01:09:44.729
What's my name? Say my name!
You gonna say my name!

800
01:09:44.772 --> 01:09:47.439
Your mama called you Clay!
I'm gonna call you Clay!

801
01:09:47.525 --> 01:09:49.567
I want you all to tell
all their aunts...

802
01:09:49.611 --> 01:09:51.611
and all their uncles
and cousins and friends...

803
01:09:51.655 --> 01:09:54.156
get to your television set,
get to your radio...

804
01:09:54.241 --> 01:09:56.783
'cause I never wanted
to whup a man so bad!

805
01:10:10.884 --> 01:10:13.677
What's my name?
What's my name?

806
01:11:09.362 --> 01:11:13.448
What's my name, motherfucker?
What's my name?

807
01:11:16.368 --> 01:11:18.451
What's my name?

808
01:11:38.225 --> 01:11:40.517
The jury has found you guilty
of refusing induction...

809
01:11:40.603 --> 01:11:43.896
into the United States
Armed Forces.

810
01:11:43.981 --> 01:11:46.023
Does the defense have anything
it wants to say?

811
01:11:46.109 --> 01:11:49.527
Yeah, I'd appreciate if the court would
just give me my sentence right now...

812
01:11:49.572 --> 01:11:52.907
rather than waitin' and stallin'.

813
01:11:52.990 --> 01:11:54.531
Very well.

814
01:11:57.287 --> 01:12:00.747
I sentence you to
the maximum sentence allowable:

815
01:12:00.791 --> 01:12:04.042
five years imprisonment
and a fine of $10,000.

816
01:12:05.630 --> 01:12:07.713
Doubtless your lawyer
will lodge an appeal...

817
01:12:07.757 --> 01:12:11.050
so while you're free on bond, I order
that your passport be surrendered.

818
01:12:11.844 --> 01:12:16.556
I'll not have you benefiting yourself
by fighting abroad.

819
01:12:16.600 --> 01:12:18.725
This court is adjourned.

820
01:12:58.310 --> 01:12:58.349
Hold on. Watch this.
I've been working on this at home.

821
01:12:58.352 --> 01:13:01.937
Hold on. Watch this.
I've been working on this at home.

822
01:13:01.979 --> 01:13:04.021
Just relax.

823
01:13:04.107 --> 01:13:07.484
See? 'Cause it's spooky and sometimes
people get scared and run.

824
01:13:07.528 --> 01:13:09.778
Pay attention.
This is very spooky.

825
01:13:12.449 --> 01:13:14.783
Go ahead.
Blow on that for me.

826
01:13:20.874 --> 01:13:22.791
See, you don't need
to fight no more.

827
01:13:26.590 --> 01:13:29.174
You don't remember me, do you?

828
01:13:31.052 --> 01:13:35.263
Yeah. I remember somethin'.
What's your name?

829
01:13:35.349 --> 01:13:37.641
- You know my name.
- I know your name.

830
01:13:37.725 --> 01:13:41.143
You came to my school
right before you won the title.

831
01:13:41.188 --> 01:13:43.855
I interviewed you
for my school paper.

832
01:13:43.941 --> 01:13:46.150
I was eleven.

833
01:13:47.236 --> 01:13:49.653
You had a long braid.

834
01:13:49.697 --> 01:13:51.697
Yeah.

835
01:13:51.783 --> 01:13:54.659
- You called me "Little Indian Girl."
- Wow.

836
01:13:56.036 --> 01:13:58.161
- Man, that was you.
- That was me.

837
01:13:59.415 --> 01:14:02.708
And I loved you then,
just like all them kids did.

838
01:14:02.794 --> 01:14:05.044
I never stopped.
I still do.

839
01:15:09.948 --> 01:15:12.282
Hey, did you see
that Ellis-Quary fight?

840
01:15:12.367 --> 01:15:14.242
Yeah.

841
01:15:16.288 --> 01:15:19.456
We're gonna be in front of
the US Court of Appeals next month.

842
01:15:19.542 --> 01:15:20.582
We're gonna lose.

843
01:15:20.626 --> 01:15:23.585
- We'll appeal to the Supreme Court.
-Jimmy Ellis, the champ.

844
01:15:23.630 --> 01:15:26.339
Man, I've been whupping on that boy
since I was 16.

845
01:15:26.423 --> 01:15:29.049
All that's gonna happen,
they gonna give Ellis to Frazier...

846
01:15:29.135 --> 01:15:31.761
Frazier's gonna kill him,
then what?

847
01:15:31.805 --> 01:15:34.890
Where's the gate?
Then they got to let me fight.

848
01:15:36.309 --> 01:15:40.270
Jimmy Ellis.
Fight that boy in a phone booth.

849
01:15:40.356 --> 01:15:44.358
Fight him in the middle of Times Square.
You think that'd draw a crowd?

850
01:15:44.442 --> 01:15:47.985
Champ, draw a crowd
or not draw a crowd...

851
01:15:48.072 --> 01:15:50.781
it's not gonna make a difference
with your boxing licenses.

852
01:15:54.370 --> 01:15:57.121
The ACLU's handling your case
against the New York Boxing Commission.

853
01:15:57.207 --> 01:15:59.958
They've discovered that New York's
got actual ex-murderers...

854
01:16:00.002 --> 01:16:02.628
and ex-rapists
currently licensed to fight.

855
01:16:02.711 --> 01:16:05.170
But revoke yours?

856
01:16:05.214 --> 01:16:08.465
They don't want you to fight.

857
01:16:08.552 --> 01:16:09.884
- Tijuana.
- No.

858
01:16:09.969 --> 01:16:12.845
State Department refuses permission
for the one-hour visa.

859
01:16:12.890 --> 01:16:15.641
No fight in Tijuana.
Look--

860
01:16:15.726 --> 01:16:19.103
Can't fight here.
Can't fight outside the country.

861
01:16:19.187 --> 01:16:21.104
I know people
in the restaurant business.

862
01:16:21.189 --> 01:16:23.690
They want to start a chain.
Muhammad Ali Champ Burgers.

863
01:16:23.776 --> 01:16:26.110
Muhammad Malts,
Fistful of Fries.

864
01:16:26.195 --> 01:16:28.028
All of that.

865
01:16:28.113 --> 01:16:30.155
Why do I wanna be
in the restaurant business?

866
01:16:30.199 --> 01:16:31.490
'Cause you need the money.

867
01:16:31.576 --> 01:16:34.494
- How much all this gonna cost?
- Too much.

868
01:16:36.332 --> 01:16:38.707
They do that to you too, you know.

869
01:16:38.791 --> 01:16:40.749
They bust you out.

870
01:16:53.892 --> 01:16:54.891
All right.

871
01:16:58.896 --> 01:17:01.397
Go get me some
Champ Burgers.

872
01:17:11.786 --> 01:17:13.744
Did y'all see that?
That man just hit me.

873
01:17:13.786 --> 01:17:17.329
Oh, you done messed up now, sucka.
You done messed up--

874
01:17:17.416 --> 01:17:19.708
I don't wanna do nothin'
in front of your daughters, though.

875
01:17:19.752 --> 01:17:21.919
I can't beat you up
in front of your daughters.

876
01:17:22.004 --> 01:17:25.798
- Hey, champ, good to see you.
- All right, ladies. Take care now.

877
01:17:25.883 --> 01:17:27.925
All right now.
All right now.

878
01:17:38.814 --> 01:17:42.441
You called me "Little Indian Girl"
'cause I wore my hair in a braid.

879
01:17:44.820 --> 01:17:46.778
And then I said,
"Man, you scribble.

880
01:17:48.241 --> 01:17:49.865
You can't even write.

881
01:17:49.949 --> 01:17:52.408
Need to go back to school
till you learn how to do it better."

882
01:17:52.452 --> 01:17:55.870
Now, why you just havin'
a fresh mouth talkin' to me.

883
01:17:55.957 --> 01:17:57.915
So you think that's funny, huh?

884
01:17:58.000 --> 01:18:00.793
Telling me I can't write,
that I scribble.

885
01:18:01.546 --> 01:18:03.713
Now you wanna try
to make up with me.

886
01:18:03.799 --> 01:18:06.925
- This will make everything better.
- Shut up.

887
01:18:25.695 --> 01:18:28.279
Mommy and Daddy
moved to Mexico!

888
01:18:46.384 --> 01:18:48.342
Come on, baby.

889
01:18:49.430 --> 01:18:51.555
Oh, sweetie, come on.

890
01:19:05.237 --> 01:19:08.822
We will give you five minutes
to leave this area.

891
01:19:12.287 --> 01:19:14.871
Who is the heavyweight champion
of the world?

892
01:19:26.260 --> 01:19:28.260
What's happenin'?

893
01:19:43.194 --> 01:19:45.653
- Hey, man.
- We lost on the appellate level...

894
01:19:45.738 --> 01:19:46.945
in New Orleans.

895
01:19:47.031 --> 01:19:49.865
- We're heading to the Supreme Court.
- We already got turned down there.

896
01:19:49.910 --> 01:19:54.705
I'm petitioning on a conscientious
objection basis. Religious belief.

897
01:19:54.789 --> 01:19:57.957
I believe that they'll hear that.

898
01:19:58.043 --> 01:20:01.044
Where the money
gonna come from, Chauncey?

899
01:20:01.130 --> 01:20:04.799
Herbert say I'm runnin' on empty.
Now, just put aside...

900
01:20:04.884 --> 01:20:06.634
"How did that happen?"

901
01:20:06.719 --> 01:20:11.556
License all revoked, passport gone,
can't fight here, can't fight nowhere.

902
01:20:11.642 --> 01:20:13.725
Then what happen if I lose
at the Supreme Court?

903
01:20:16.229 --> 01:20:18.521
Then you go to jail for five years.

904
01:21:34.228 --> 01:21:36.979
Oh, I saw Bundini
when I was in Europe.

905
01:21:37.064 --> 01:21:41.525
- Yeah? How is he?
- He's bad. He's in bad shape, man.

906
01:21:41.568 --> 01:21:44.486
You better get your belt back

907
01:21:48.660 --> 01:21:51.453
Look at this.

908
01:21:51.537 --> 01:21:53.996
Joe Frazier.
He can't up no gate.

909
01:21:54.040 --> 01:21:57.083
Can't fill no arena.
They got to let me fight.

910
01:21:57.169 --> 01:21:58.710
Fight.

911
01:22:02.090 --> 01:22:07.427
If that happens, promise me you’ll
put some new people around you.

912
01:22:10.224 --> 01:22:12.099
What you talkin' about?

913
01:22:13.269 --> 01:22:15.519
Where Herbert and them
when we need 'em?

914
01:22:15.564 --> 01:22:19.900
Gene Kilroy's dropping off groceries
like charity.

915
01:22:22.111 --> 01:22:25.279
We borrow money from my folks.

916
01:22:25.365 --> 01:22:29.785
They're all over you when you got it,
and then they just drop off you...

917
01:22:29.870 --> 01:22:31.536
when you don't.

918
01:22:44.010 --> 01:22:46.928
Norton, he's big and strong,
but he ain't nothin'.

919
01:22:47.013 --> 01:22:50.223
Hold on a second, Joe.
They're telling me we have a caller.

920
01:22:50.308 --> 01:22:53.643
- Go ahead, please.
- Cosell, this is Muhammad Ali.

921
01:22:53.727 --> 01:22:54.976
It's Muhammad Ali.

922
01:22:55.062 --> 01:22:57.145
Everybody knows
that I am the champ.

923
01:22:57.232 --> 01:23:00.609
The crown is a lie. I know it's a lie.
Joe Frazier knows it's a lie.

924
01:23:00.694 --> 01:23:03.069
And it's time for everybody
to stop lying and tell the truth.

925
01:23:03.113 --> 01:23:06.490
Let's tell it like it is.
With your court and boxing problems...

926
01:23:06.575 --> 01:23:08.575
can you get a fight promoted?

927
01:23:08.661 --> 01:23:10.870
I would fight Joe Frazier for free
in a phone booth...

928
01:23:10.954 --> 01:23:13.329
in the middle of Times Square
if I wasn't broke.

929
01:23:13.415 --> 01:23:15.582
Did you say you were broke?
How can you be broke?

930
01:23:15.668 --> 01:23:19.128
You made more money than all previous
heavyweights champions combined.

931
01:23:19.172 --> 01:23:21.714
What about your management?
Surely they have provided for you.

932
01:23:21.799 --> 01:23:24.925
All I'm trying to say is it's time
for everybody to stop lyin'.

933
01:23:25.011 --> 01:23:26.719
Muhammad Ali is the champ.

934
01:23:26.805 --> 01:23:29.848
Get my son Herbert
on the telephone.

935
01:23:29.932 --> 01:23:32.766
Muhammad, thank you for calling in.
I'll relay that to Joe.

936
01:23:32.811 --> 01:23:36.980
And tell Joe I said
he is very ugly.

937
01:23:38.400 --> 01:23:41.610
Muhammad says that he will
fight you anywhere, anytime...

938
01:23:41.695 --> 01:23:46.448
and that the championship really is his
until that battle ensues.

939
01:23:59.673 --> 01:24:03.091
Mr. Ali has sporting blood.

940
01:24:03.177 --> 01:24:06.262
Mr. Ali wants a place
in this sports world.

941
01:24:06.346 --> 01:24:09.097
He loves it too much.

942
01:24:09.182 --> 01:24:13.643
I am therefore suspending Mr. Ali
from the practice of Islam.

943
01:24:13.729 --> 01:24:17.898
He may no longer appear in temple,
pray or teach...

944
01:24:17.984 --> 01:24:23.029
or have any conversation
with any Muslim whatsoever.

945
01:24:26.701 --> 01:24:28.284
Why didn’t you call
an ambulance or a doctor?

946
01:24:28.369 --> 01:24:30.995
Because he gave me your number
when he checked in.

947
01:24:31.039 --> 01:24:33.248
Normally, he's up there
making a lot of noise.

948
01:24:33.333 --> 01:24:35.792
But now he hasn't answered the door
in three days.

949
01:24:39.257 --> 01:24:41.007
- What's that?
- It's daylight.

950
01:24:42.550 --> 01:24:44.508
Get me that short dog.

951
01:24:47.014 --> 01:24:49.348
Give it to me.

952
01:24:52.061 --> 01:24:53.185
What's wrong with you?

953
01:24:53.229 --> 01:24:56.105
Ain't nothin' wrong with me.
My head ain't bad.

954
01:24:56.191 --> 01:24:58.108
- Leave me alone.
- Leave you alone. You called me!

955
01:24:58.193 --> 01:25:00.777
Yes, but that was a week ago.

956
01:25:00.861 --> 01:25:03.070
- Why are you shamin' yourself?
- Let me go, man.

957
01:25:03.156 --> 01:25:04.906
Why you doin' that
to yourself?

958
01:25:04.991 --> 01:25:07.700
- Why you shamin' yourself?
- Ain't nobody shamed.

959
01:25:07.744 --> 01:25:10.036
Ain't nothin' wrong with me.

960
01:25:10.080 --> 01:25:11.913
I'm flyin'.

961
01:25:11.999 --> 01:25:14.082
The Sky Chief talk through me.
I know the word.

962
01:25:14.168 --> 01:25:15.542
- You know low.
- Yeah?

963
01:25:15.587 --> 01:25:17.837
I know low where the king
is goin' back to his throne!

964
01:25:17.921 --> 01:25:20.714
- From the root to the fruit!
- Them rhymes is old, Bundini.

965
01:25:20.758 --> 01:25:22.716
You need to get some new ones.

966
01:25:26.597 --> 01:25:30.433
God don't care about you.
Don't care about me.

967
01:25:30.519 --> 01:25:33.729
In all of everything, we don't mean
nothin'. He don't owe us.

968
01:25:33.814 --> 01:25:35.522
We be.

969
01:25:35.606 --> 01:25:38.899
And that's the onliest thing He did.

970
01:25:38.985 --> 01:25:42.070
But that's good.
That's why we free.

971
01:25:42.114 --> 01:25:45.950
But free ain't easy. Free is real
and real is a motherfucker.

972
01:25:48.204 --> 01:25:50.955
It eats raw meat.

973
01:25:51.041 --> 01:25:53.583
It walk in its own shoes.

974
01:25:53.667 --> 01:25:56.126
It don't ever waiver.

975
01:25:56.212 --> 01:25:57.670
Yeah.

976
01:26:03.636 --> 01:26:06.512
I-- I sold your belt.

977
01:26:07.891 --> 01:26:10.850
I sold your belt to a barber
for $500 on Lenox Avenue.

978
01:26:10.935 --> 01:26:14.437
That's how low I did you.
I couldn't help it. I got a crazy mind.

979
01:26:16.734 --> 01:26:18.859
That belt say you the heavyweight
boxing champion of the world...

980
01:26:18.945 --> 01:26:21.863
and I took that $500...

981
01:26:21.947 --> 01:26:24.364
and I put it in my arm.

982
01:26:26.202 --> 01:26:28.244
That's what I called to tell you.

983
01:26:35.504 --> 01:26:38.797
I heard about the Nation stuff,
the courtroom.

984
01:26:40.717 --> 01:26:42.675
What you gonna do?

985
01:26:53.689 --> 01:26:55.522
Take me back.

986
01:27:03.949 --> 01:27:07.117
I could go down there and get the belt.
I can go get the belt.

987
01:27:46.954 --> 01:27:48.912
Hey, champ.

988
01:28:22.491 --> 01:28:28.412
$1,000 to the man that bring me
Howard Cosell's toupee dead or alive!

989
01:28:28.456 --> 01:28:31.082
Don't bother me.
I'm a world-famous sportscaster...

990
01:28:31.126 --> 01:28:33.418
and you're an ex-champion
with diminished skills.

991
01:28:33.503 --> 01:28:35.253
I can't be seen with you.

992
01:28:38.633 --> 01:28:41.426
- How's it goin', champ?
- Pretty good, man.

993
01:28:47.184 --> 01:28:50.519
Muhammad, I'd do anything for you.
You know that.

994
01:28:50.605 --> 01:28:56.068
But I've got bosses who only
give a damn about Nielsen ratings.

995
01:28:56.151 --> 01:28:58.777
I guarantee...

996
01:28:58.863 --> 01:29:02.657
it will be a historical
and a momentous night.

997
01:29:08.707 --> 01:29:12.125
If they came to me tomorrow and say,
"We want you to fight Joe Frazier.

998
01:29:12.168 --> 01:29:15.169
Madison Square Garden.
Millions and millions of dollars.

999
01:29:15.213 --> 01:29:17.797
Here's your license back."
I will tell them...

1000
01:29:17.883 --> 01:29:19.633
"I will never fight again."

1001
01:29:19.718 --> 01:29:23.178
Frankly, Muhammad, I'm surprised,
because unless you--

1002
01:29:23.222 --> 01:29:25.681
or until you fight Frazier--

1003
01:29:25.767 --> 01:29:29.728
Cosell, are you losin' your hearing
along with your hair?

1004
01:29:29.811 --> 01:29:32.854
Don't put no question to it, man.
I done told you, I'm through fightin'.

1005
01:29:32.940 --> 01:29:35.315
I got a much bigger contender,
a much heavier opponent.

1006
01:29:35.401 --> 01:29:37.318
I'm fightin'
the entire US government.

1007
01:29:38.571 --> 01:29:41.072
Do you think
you're going to jail?

1008
01:29:41.157 --> 01:29:43.824
I don't know. I don't know.

1009
01:29:43.869 --> 01:29:49.498
Joe Frazier told me on this show
that he could knock you out.

1010
01:29:49.541 --> 01:29:51.833
See, there you go agitatin'.

1011
01:29:51.877 --> 01:29:55.754
You should've asked Smokin' Joe
what have he been smokin'?

1012
01:29:55.839 --> 01:29:59.591
That boy even dream he whupped me,
he better wake up and apologize.

1013
01:29:59.677 --> 01:30:01.719
If I was to get in the ring with Joe...

1014
01:30:01.805 --> 01:30:03.722
here's what you might see.

1015
01:30:03.805 --> 01:30:08.517
Ali comes out to meet Frazier,
but Frazier starts to retreat.

1016
01:30:08.561 --> 01:30:12.814
If Joe goes back an inch farther,
he'll wind up in a ringside seat.

1017
01:30:12.898 --> 01:30:16.024
Ali swings with his left,
Ali swings with his right.

1018
01:30:16.111 --> 01:30:18.278
Just look at the kid
carry the fight.

1019
01:30:18.363 --> 01:30:20.947
Frazier keeps backin',
but there's not enough room.

1020
01:30:21.033 --> 01:30:24.493
It's only a matter of time
before Ali lowers the boom.

1021
01:30:24.577 --> 01:30:27.370
Ali swings with his right.
What a beautiful swing.

1022
01:30:27.456 --> 01:30:30.374
But the punch lifts Frazier
clean out of the ring.

1023
01:30:30.417 --> 01:30:33.210
Frazier's still risin',
and the referee wears a frown...

1024
01:30:33.295 --> 01:30:36.672
'cause he can't start countin'
till Frazier comes down.

1025
01:30:36.758 --> 01:30:40.093
Frazier's disappeared from view.
The crowd is getting frantic.

1026
01:30:40.177 --> 01:30:44.138
But our radar stations picked him up.
He's somewhere over the Atlantic.

1027
01:30:44.223 --> 01:30:46.473
Now, who would've thought
when they came to the fight...

1028
01:30:46.559 --> 01:30:50.520
they was gonna witness the launchin'
of a black satellite.

1029
01:30:50.605 --> 01:30:53.106
But don't wait for that fight.

1030
01:30:53.192 --> 01:30:55.359
It ain't never gonna happen.

1031
01:30:55.444 --> 01:30:57.527
Only thing you could do...

1032
01:30:57.612 --> 01:31:01.114
is wonder and imagine.

1033
01:31:01.700 --> 01:31:07.538
This has been another
sports exclusive from ABC.

1034
01:31:07.623 --> 01:31:09.623
- Two. Go two.
- Over to Jim McKay...

1035
01:31:09.709 --> 01:31:11.959
in Bern, Switzerland.

1036
01:31:12.045 --> 01:31:14.254
- How you gonna go from me to Jim McKay?
- Listen, uh--

1037
01:31:15.464 --> 01:31:19.133
- Did your wife leave you yet?
- No, she hasn't left me yet.

1038
01:31:19.218 --> 01:31:21.552
She's going to, 'cause I
told your wife when I seen her...

1039
01:31:21.638 --> 01:31:24.889
I said, "Listen, why you
doin' this to yourself?"

1040
01:31:34.025 --> 01:31:37.610
Oh, man, Joe.
Who dresses you?

1041
01:31:37.696 --> 01:31:40.572
You look like the heavyweight
champion of pimps.

1042
01:31:40.658 --> 01:31:42.700
Hey, shut up and get in.

1043
01:31:43.995 --> 01:31:45.536
That jacket’s a mess, man.

1044
01:31:49.835 --> 01:31:52.336
What you in Philly for?
Philly's my town.

1045
01:31:52.420 --> 01:31:55.421
Well, I just wanted to get
a little closer to you, honey.

1046
01:31:55.507 --> 01:31:56.506
Man, fuck you.

1047
01:31:58.844 --> 01:32:02.304
There'll be two undefeated heavyweight
champions, and they ain't fightin'.

1048
01:32:02.347 --> 01:32:05.056
- What about your license?
- I can fight in Atlanta.

1049
01:32:05.142 --> 01:32:07.809
There ain't no state boxing commission
in Georgia.

1050
01:32:07.854 --> 01:32:11.147
It's all set. I do a prelim in Atlanta
against Jerry Quary...

1051
01:32:11.189 --> 01:32:13.815
but we got to get this
steamroller movin' right now.

1052
01:32:13.859 --> 01:32:15.483
So what do I have to do?

1053
01:32:15.528 --> 01:32:18.946
All you got to do is announce
that after I whup Jerry Quary...

1054
01:32:19.031 --> 01:32:21.532
you gonna give me a title shot.

1055
01:32:21.618 --> 01:32:24.244
Come on, man.
Say it! Say it!

1056
01:32:33.005 --> 01:32:36.507
What I got and all I got,
I got with these right here.

1057
01:32:36.591 --> 01:32:38.841
Hell, man, I already got the title.

1058
01:32:38.928 --> 01:32:43.473
So I ain't got nothin' to win,
but I got eveythin' to lose.

1059
01:32:45.058 --> 01:32:47.433
Yeah, but you know
you ain't the real champ yet.

1060
01:32:56.571 --> 01:32:58.696
You beat Quary...

1061
01:32:58.740 --> 01:33:01.866
I'm gonna get you in the ring.
I'm gonna kick your ass.

1062
01:33:12.796 --> 01:33:15.171
By the way...

1063
01:33:15.258 --> 01:33:19.636
you need any money
or anything to tide you by?

1064
01:33:21.054 --> 01:33:22.971
No, I'm fine.

1065
01:33:37.907 --> 01:33:40.366
Time!

1066
01:33:47.916 --> 01:33:50.542
What you want?

1067
01:33:53.089 --> 01:33:55.047
Take me back, boss.

1068
01:33:56.800 --> 01:33:58.717
I'm clean.

1069
01:33:58.803 --> 01:34:03.181
This is a resurrection.
This is God's act.

1070
01:34:03.266 --> 01:34:06.434
And the prophet is goin' home.

1071
01:34:06.519 --> 01:34:08.853
Take me with you, boss.

1072
01:34:09.899 --> 01:34:11.982
I'll do anything.

1073
01:34:22.495 --> 01:34:26.372
Your hands can't hit
what your eyes can't see.

1074
01:34:29.378 --> 01:34:33.214
Float like a butterfly,
sting like a bee.

1075
01:34:33.297 --> 01:34:35.714
Rumble, young man, rumble.

1076
01:34:54.111 --> 01:34:54.275
God ain't watching'!
Ain't nobody but us!

1077
01:34:54.278 --> 01:34:57.821
God ain't watching'!
Ain't nobody but us!

1078
01:35:04.957 --> 01:35:07.791
There it is!
Stay in his face!

1079
01:35:11.671 --> 01:35:13.504
Go, Muhammad!

1080
01:35:25.020 --> 01:35:26.352
There it is!

1081
01:35:32.569 --> 01:35:34.152
Now for the right. Boom!

1082
01:35:40.536 --> 01:35:42.494
Prophet is goin' home
to the throne.

1083
01:35:59.306 --> 01:36:01.515
That's how you do it, Ali.

1084
01:36:01.598 --> 01:36:03.848
That's how you do it.

1085
01:36:10.942 --> 01:36:13.526
You okay?
You're a goddamn Superman.

1086
01:36:13.612 --> 01:36:15.862
Ain't no kryptonite
in this ring tonight.

1087
01:37:00.244 --> 01:37:02.453
- We want Joe Frazier!
- We want him!

1088
01:37:02.539 --> 01:37:07.084
- We want Joe Frazier!
- And you deserve it. You deserve it.

1089
01:37:10.798 --> 01:37:13.841
This prophet is comin' home,
goin' from the darkness to the light.

1090
01:37:16.636 --> 01:37:18.886
Soak it in this
for about 20 minutes.

1091
01:37:21.016 --> 01:37:23.850
We don't need their management.

1092
01:37:24.812 --> 01:37:28.189
Hey, Herbert, we did good.
Doin' good tonight.

1093
01:37:39.870 --> 01:37:41.620
All praise to Allah.

1094
01:37:45.167 --> 01:37:47.709
The messenger has lifted
your suspension.

1095
01:37:47.795 --> 01:37:49.712
Congratulations.

1096
01:37:49.796 --> 01:37:51.796
So you’re sayin'
I can be a Muslim again.

1097
01:37:51.881 --> 01:37:53.464
- Yes.
- I ain't never stopped.

1098
01:37:53.550 --> 01:37:55.508
Just like I ain't never stopped
bein' the champ.

1099
01:37:57.722 --> 01:37:59.388
I begged my father
to reinstate you.

1100
01:37:59.473 --> 01:38:02.266
When? When you do that, Herbert?

1101
01:38:02.352 --> 01:38:04.769
After I promoted this Quary fight
or after I won it?

1102
01:38:05.731 --> 01:38:07.773
- We can get Frazier.
- Man, I done already got Frazier.

1103
01:38:07.856 --> 01:38:10.315
We can get $5 million for Frazier.

1104
01:38:10.401 --> 01:38:13.527
We talkin' management,
talkin' money or talkin' religion?

1105
01:38:13.572 --> 01:38:16.573
When I got leery
and talked up why I'm broke...

1106
01:38:16.658 --> 01:38:18.199
then come the suspension.

1107
01:38:18.285 --> 01:38:21.828
Now you explain that one to me,
my brother.

1108
01:38:21.914 --> 01:38:24.081
That was my father.

1109
01:38:26.626 --> 01:38:28.584
Your father.

1110
01:38:28.629 --> 01:38:32.757
I love your father, Herbert.
I swear, man. I love the Nation.

1111
01:38:32.842 --> 01:38:35.301
But it don't own me.

1112
01:38:44.437 --> 01:38:47.188
You go on out there
and you make that Frazier deal.

1113
01:38:52.445 --> 01:38:54.362
My brother.
Yeah, your brother Herbert.

1114
01:38:54.448 --> 01:38:56.323
Go on somewhere,
make that deal.

1115
01:39:06.919 --> 01:39:10.212
And he accepts me.
I’m Jewish, but yet he's Muslim...

1116
01:39:10.297 --> 01:39:11.755
and we still get along.

1117
01:39:11.841 --> 01:39:15.343
He understands me. He understands me
and he still allows me to hang with him.

1118
01:39:15.429 --> 01:39:18.889
He knows I like pork and white women,
but still allows me to be here with him.

1119
01:39:18.973 --> 01:39:20.931
Now, I can give up pork...

1120
01:39:20.975 --> 01:39:23.768
but them white women,
goddamn it!

1121
01:39:23.854 --> 01:39:25.896
How you deal with it, boy?

1122
01:39:39.787 --> 01:39:43.080
Hello?
Muhammad, it's for you.

1123
01:39:47.545 --> 01:39:49.754
Thank you, Lana.

1124
01:39:49.840 --> 01:39:52.966
- Yeah?
- Muhammad? Howard Cosell.

1125
01:39:53.010 --> 01:39:56.637
- You TKO'd them.
- Hey, what you talkin' about, Howard?

1126
01:39:56.721 --> 01:39:58.721
- With Quary?
- No.

1127
01:39:58.807 --> 01:40:00.724
The Supreme Court ruled today...

1128
01:40:00.809 --> 01:40:04.144
in the case of The United States
vs. Cassius Clay...

1129
01:40:04.188 --> 01:40:07.982
aka Muhammad Ali.

1130
01:40:08.067 --> 01:40:12.028
You won an eight-to-zero
unanimous decision.

1131
01:40:12.072 --> 01:40:14.906
You're free.

1132
01:40:14.990 --> 01:40:16.948
Congratulations.

1133
01:40:33.343 --> 01:40:34.801
I'm free.

1134
01:40:40.726 --> 01:40:42.643
The Supreme Court
just set me free.

1135
01:40:47.526 --> 01:40:49.985
What are you talkin' about?

1136
01:40:51.320 --> 01:40:52.819
Eight-to-oh, unanimous decision.

1137
01:40:52.906 --> 01:40:55.615
The Supreme Court
just overturned my conviction.

1138
01:40:57.410 --> 01:41:00.119
- Yes!
- All right. All right.

1139
01:41:00.205 --> 01:41:01.663
- Did we get 'em, Ali?
- We got 'em, man.

1140
01:41:03.584 --> 01:41:05.709
Hey, man.

1141
01:41:07.087 --> 01:41:10.505
- Did we do it?
- We did it, man.

1142
01:41:10.591 --> 01:41:14.051
They wanna be on your side now because
the truth has shown itself to the power.

1143
01:41:14.137 --> 01:41:16.971
Now the power's comin' to the truth.
That's what it is.

1144
01:41:17.056 --> 01:41:19.473
And the truth tastes good
when there's a belly full of lies.

1145
01:41:19.559 --> 01:41:22.685
- What you talkin' about?
- It don't matter. It don't matter.

1146
01:41:31.488 --> 01:41:34.197
Ladies and gentlemen,
15 rounds of boxing...

1147
01:41:34.282 --> 01:41:38.994
for the undisputed heavyweight
championship of the world.

1148
01:41:39.080 --> 01:41:43.958
In this corner, the contender and former
heavyweight champion of the world...

1149
01:41:44.042 --> 01:41:48.211
weighing in at 213 pounds...

1150
01:41:48.298 --> 01:41:52.134
with a record of 31 and 0
with 25 knockouts...

1151
01:41:52.218 --> 01:41:54.885
Muhammad Ali!

1152
01:42:00.309 --> 01:42:05.021
His opponent,
weighing in at 2051/2 pounds...

1153
01:42:05.107 --> 01:42:09.235
with a record of 26 and 0
with 23 knockouts...

1154
01:42:09.319 --> 01:42:12.862
the current heavyweight
champion of the world...

1155
01:42:12.949 --> 01:42:17.202
Smokin? Joe Frazier!

1156
01:42:19.246 --> 01:42:22.664
I want a good, clean fight.
Protect yourself at all times.

1157
01:42:22.750 --> 01:42:25.960
Gentlemen, touch gloves.
Good luck to both of you.

1158
01:43:04.795 --> 01:43:05.961
Come on!

1159
01:43:06.046 --> 01:43:08.046
Stick him! Come on!

1160
01:43:50.676 --> 01:43:52.759
That's okay, champ.
Don't stop fightin'.

1161
01:43:54.848 --> 01:43:56.139
What's comin'?

1162
01:43:56.224 --> 01:43:59.559
Lean back, man.
Move back. Work, legs.

1163
01:44:12.116 --> 01:44:13.323
Ain't nobody hurt.

1164
01:44:13.409 --> 01:44:15.868
That's all right.
Ain't no--

1165
01:44:33.805 --> 01:44:35.179
Keep puttin' out.
Come on.

1166
01:44:46.986 --> 01:44:49.779
- Move, Ali!
- Back, back, back!

1167
01:45:23.107 --> 01:45:25.024
Muhammad, you said
you were gonna win the fight.

1168
01:45:25.109 --> 01:45:27.109
How do you account
for the beating you've taken?

1169
01:45:27.194 --> 01:45:29.903
- Did he hurt you?
-Joe said you don't wanna fight again.

1170
01:45:29.989 --> 01:45:32.531
Oh, how wrong he is.

1171
01:45:32.618 --> 01:45:34.159
- Why would it be different?
- Muhammad, wait!

1172
01:45:39.249 --> 01:45:42.542
- But I wanna ask him something!
- We all wanna ask him something.

1173
01:45:42.628 --> 01:45:45.212
- Sons of bitches! Get outta here!
- When are you gonna get a hairpiece?

1174
01:45:45.297 --> 01:45:47.297
Don't worry about it.
You lost all of yours.

1175
01:45:47.383 --> 01:45:49.341
You cue ball head motherfucker.
Get outta here!

1176
01:45:49.385 --> 01:45:51.760
-Just one more question.
- Let me talk to him.

1177
01:45:51.846 --> 01:45:54.096
We're close to the start
of round one.

1178
01:45:54.181 --> 01:45:56.014
Now that Smokin? Joe
done run outta tomato cans...

1179
01:45:56.100 --> 01:45:59.685
I got Yank to commit to a rematch
with you in about six months.

1180
01:45:59.729 --> 01:46:01.938
Frazier said he'd be happy
with three mil.

1181
01:46:02.022 --> 01:46:06.442
I'll fly to Jamaica, get Yank to sign
right after Joe beats this big stiff.

1182
01:46:07.905 --> 01:46:10.447
I think he hurt Joe Frazier.

1183
01:46:10.533 --> 01:46:13.200
I think Joe is hurt.

1184
01:46:13.242 --> 01:46:16.827
Down goes Frazier!
Down goes Frazier!

1185
01:46:16.914 --> 01:46:18.705
- Down goes Frazier!
- Get up, Joe.

1186
01:46:18.749 --> 01:46:22.334
The heavy weight champion is
taking the mandatory eightcount...

1187
01:46:22.419 --> 01:46:25.378
and Foreman
Is poised as can be.

1188
01:46:27.300 --> 01:46:29.759
Foreman is all over Frazier.

1189
01:46:29.843 --> 01:46:32.177
And Frazier is down again!

1190
01:46:32.263 --> 01:46:34.805
He maybe--
No, he's rising.

1191
01:46:36.726 --> 01:46:38.058
It's over! It is over!

1192
01:46:38.102 --> 01:46:41.437
It'd be easy to get a fight
with Frazier now.

1193
01:46:41.523 --> 01:46:45.776
Only thing he's champion of
is gettin' knocked down.

1194
01:46:45.862 --> 01:46:49.823
George Foreman is
the heavyweight champion of the world.

1195
01:46:51.617 --> 01:46:55.578
The Rumble in the Jungle.
That is the name that I've given it.

1196
01:46:55.663 --> 01:47:00.208
Muhammad Ali and George Foreman
in Kinshasa, Zaire.

1197
01:47:00.293 --> 01:47:02.293
- Don, Zaire?
- Yeah, Don.

1198
01:47:02.379 --> 01:47:04.754
I mean, why not Antarctica,
somethin' like that?

1199
01:47:04.838 --> 01:47:06.921
What's wrong with New York City?

1200
01:47:08.801 --> 01:47:10.843
Because you miss the significance.

1201
01:47:10.929 --> 01:47:15.140
See, I dream of overcoming
400 years of racial depression...

1202
01:47:15.225 --> 01:47:19.436
to the dawn of a new day of liberation,
financial and otherwise.

1203
01:47:19.522 --> 01:47:22.648
It will raise up the spirits
of our inner cities.

1204
01:47:22.732 --> 01:47:25.233
It will rise up and fill with hope,
the souls...

1205
01:47:25.318 --> 01:47:27.902
the unrequited needs
of the black proletariat.

1206
01:47:27.988 --> 01:47:30.822
That is, the discouraged, dispirited,
denigrated denizens...

1207
01:47:30.909 --> 01:47:33.910
of the demimonde
that is called the ghetto.

1208
01:47:33.995 --> 01:47:36.788
Man, Don, you crazy.

1209
01:47:36.831 --> 01:47:40.792
You must've studied the whole
"D" section of the dictionary.

1210
01:48:05.403 --> 01:48:07.320
Good morning, sister.

1211
01:48:09.782 --> 01:48:11.448
Hi, brother.

1212
01:48:13.453 --> 01:48:15.328
How you doin', champ?

1213
01:48:42.526 --> 01:48:44.609
Why they saying that?
What they sayin'?

1214
01:48:48.949 --> 01:48:51.032
What that mean?
I don't understand.

1215
01:48:51.118 --> 01:48:52.659
- It means--
- What?

1216
01:48:52.743 --> 01:48:56.161
It mean, "Ali, kill him.
Ali, kill him."

1217
01:49:42.756 --> 01:49:45.507
The champ is here!

1218
01:49:45.593 --> 01:49:49.387
Ladies and gentlemen, the heavyweight
champion of the world has arrived!

1219
01:49:50.972 --> 01:49:53.014
The champ is here!

1220
01:49:58.480 --> 01:50:00.230
Hey, man.

1221
01:50:00.316 --> 01:50:02.441
He's quite younger than you.
How you feeling about that?

1222
01:50:02.527 --> 01:50:05.194
He's quite younger than me?
Well, we quite younger than you.

1223
01:50:05.278 --> 01:50:09.739
What you talkin' about? Thirty-two
years old. Best shape of my life.

1224
01:51:07.177 --> 01:51:09.803
Hey, stop!
All right, back up.

1225
01:51:16.603 --> 01:51:19.854
Did you see Muhammad Ali?

1226
01:55:40.048 --> 01:55:43.591
- Here's your water.
- Oh, thank you, hon.

1227
01:55:43.678 --> 01:55:47.096
Bottled water.
Frozen steaks.

1228
01:55:47.180 --> 01:55:49.806
Brought all that stuffin
like Africa's ain't got no steaks.

1229
01:55:49.892 --> 01:55:53.811
- You could pick up parasites.
- Mobutu eats it.

1230
01:55:53.854 --> 01:55:56.438
Mobutu's takin' care of Mobutu.

1231
01:55:56.524 --> 01:55:59.150
He steals all the wealth
and sends it to Switzerland.

1232
01:56:00.529 --> 01:56:02.904
What that got to do
with any of why we here?

1233
01:56:02.988 --> 01:56:08.367
We are here 'cause Don King
got Mobutu to put up $10 million.

1234
01:56:08.453 --> 01:56:12.247
Don King don't care about Africa.
He's worse than Herbert.

1235
01:56:12.957 --> 01:56:15.332
Here come Herbert.

1236
01:56:15.419 --> 01:56:18.128
And Don King fit right in too.

1237
01:56:18.214 --> 01:56:20.506
Now he's a dashiki-wearin' rip-off.

1238
01:56:20.590 --> 01:56:22.590
Don King delivered the first-ever...

1239
01:56:22.676 --> 01:56:24.926
black-promoted
championship fight in Africa.

1240
01:56:25.012 --> 01:56:28.931
Don King talks black,
lives white and thinks green.

1241
01:56:29.017 --> 01:56:31.351
And you're defending him
and Brother Herbert?

1242
01:56:31.394 --> 01:56:34.353
'Cause clean-cut Muslims in a parade
on the South Side of Chicago...

1243
01:56:34.397 --> 01:56:37.482
ain't gonna get this done!

1244
01:56:38.358 --> 01:56:41.234
I got to put honkies with connections
and bad-ass niggas to it.

1245
01:56:41.320 --> 01:56:43.237
And now they matched you up
against George Foreman.

1246
01:56:43.323 --> 01:56:46.282
Do you think they give a damn
if you get killed?

1247
01:56:52.625 --> 01:56:54.667
So that's what you think?

1248
01:57:03.928 --> 01:57:06.929
I just wanna know why
my Muslim husband...

1249
01:57:07.014 --> 01:57:10.057
is allowing himself
to get strung up on a cross.

1250
01:57:10.143 --> 01:57:12.143
Just tell me why.

1251
01:57:20.487 --> 01:57:22.153
Mayum's sick.

1252
01:57:27.578 --> 01:57:30.496
Maybe I ought to go back
to Chicago and look after her?

1253
01:57:33.417 --> 01:57:34.875
Sure.

1254
01:57:41.676 --> 01:57:44.302
Well, then I guess
I'll be back before the fight.

1255
01:57:45.847 --> 01:57:48.222
If that’s all right, my husband.

1256
01:58:14.336 --> 01:58:16.294
This fight is no contest!

1257
01:58:16.380 --> 01:58:18.338
He is entirely too slow to fight me.

1258
01:58:18.423 --> 01:58:20.924
I say that George Foreman
is a mummy.

1259
01:58:21.009 --> 01:58:23.885
He's too slow.
You know I name all my fighters.

1260
01:58:23.971 --> 01:58:26.138
I'm gonna call George Foreman
"The Mummy."

1261
01:58:26.180 --> 01:58:28.430
He fight like a mummy.

1262
01:58:32.271 --> 01:58:35.105
And when I see George throwin' punches,
this is what I hear:

1263
01:58:35.190 --> 01:58:37.565
Here come the left.

1264
01:58:37.652 --> 01:58:39.902
Here come the right.

1265
01:58:39.988 --> 01:58:42.655
But the mummy can't hit
what the mummy can't see...

1266
01:58:42.741 --> 01:58:44.616
'cause I'm too fast for him.

1267
01:58:46.202 --> 01:58:48.995
I'm too fast.

1268
01:58:49.080 --> 01:58:53.041
I'm too fast. I'm too fast.
I move too good for him.

1269
01:58:53.126 --> 01:58:56.127
I'll hit George Foreman so many times,
he'll think he's surrounded.

1270
01:58:57.381 --> 01:59:00.799
He gonna say, "Call the police!
It's five of 'em in here!"

1271
01:59:02.469 --> 01:59:04.678
I'm bad, man. I'm bad!

1272
01:59:04.721 --> 01:59:08.598
Muhammad, I'm sorry.
I have to ask.

1273
01:59:09.269 --> 01:59:11.311
Are you really
fast enough anymore...

1274
01:59:11.395 --> 01:59:13.645
to beat George Foreman?

1275
01:59:13.690 --> 01:59:18.527
If he gets you against the ropes,
he can knock you out with either hand.

1276
01:59:18.571 --> 01:59:23.199
Many people believe you’re not the man
you used to be ten years ago.

1277
01:59:26.245 --> 01:59:27.953
See, now, Howard...

1278
01:59:28.039 --> 01:59:31.374
I didn't even want to talk
about this, man.

1279
01:59:32.877 --> 01:59:36.671
Especially not out here
in front of all these people.

1280
01:59:36.715 --> 01:59:39.382
But I talked to your wife...

1281
01:59:39.466 --> 01:59:43.719
and she said you not the man
you used to be two years ago!

1282
02:00:06.203 --> 02:00:08.161
Champ.

1283
02:00:12.252 --> 02:00:15.170
- Champ, George had an accident.
- He-- He had what?

1284
02:00:15.254 --> 02:00:18.047
- What are you talking about?
- He got cut right above his right eye.

1285
02:00:18.132 --> 02:00:20.633
His sparring partner's elbow
split it open.

1286
02:00:20.719 --> 02:00:23.220
- Can he fight?
- Not for six weeks.

1287
02:00:25.182 --> 02:00:27.265
This is not a humorous situation,
my champ.

1288
02:00:27.351 --> 02:00:30.978
This postponement could be long,
especially if George leaves.

1289
02:00:31.064 --> 02:00:33.273
You tying to
pull something here, Don?

1290
02:00:33.356 --> 02:00:36.023
If George leaves, he ain't comin' back.
George don't like it here.

1291
02:00:37.111 --> 02:00:40.738
How right you are, my suspicious
and short Italian brother.

1292
02:00:40.781 --> 02:00:43.532
Look here, man,
my fiduciary responsibility...

1293
02:00:43.618 --> 02:00:46.035
to this first all-black promotion...

1294
02:00:46.121 --> 02:00:49.623
is analogous to a garden in the African
sun-- it must grow, it must bloom.

1295
02:00:49.706 --> 02:00:54.126
Cannot flower in the gloom and shade
of postponement to the Astrodome...

1296
02:00:54.170 --> 02:00:56.963
or any dome out of Zaire where it be
deprivileged of light and bled of water.

1297
02:00:57.007 --> 02:01:00.676
'Cause what gonna be bleedin' out of
there is money-- a hemorrhage of cash.

1298
02:01:00.761 --> 02:01:02.678
I'm talkin' about blood on the floor.

1299
02:01:02.763 --> 02:01:06.265
Double hotel costs, airplane,
travel costs, food and beverage.

1300
02:01:06.351 --> 02:01:10.228
- So what do you want us to do?
- Muhammad Ali. The people's champion.

1301
02:01:10.312 --> 02:01:11.561
My black brother.

1302
02:01:11.647 --> 02:01:14.440
I need you.
I need your strength.

1303
02:01:14.525 --> 02:01:17.776
I need you to find a way
to get George to stay.

1304
02:01:17.820 --> 02:01:20.237
Be Moses in reverse.

1305
02:01:20.323 --> 02:01:24.409
Do not let my people go.
Keep them the fuck right here in Egypt.

1306
02:01:24.495 --> 02:01:26.745
- If you’ll pardon my Swahili.
- Lingala.

1307
02:01:26.829 --> 02:01:29.121
- Say what?
- They speak Lingala.

1308
02:01:30.208 --> 02:01:33.585
Ali wants his title,
and he wants it in Zaire.

1309
02:01:37.550 --> 02:01:40.259
Okay, all right, okay.
Let's take it back.

1310
02:01:40.345 --> 02:01:43.513
George go, George go.
Hell, I can get you Joe Frazier.

1311
02:01:43.597 --> 02:01:46.682
Ali-Frazier 3.
That's the fight everybody want to see.

1312
02:01:46.767 --> 02:01:50.686
- We don't want Frazier, we want George.
- Hell, I don't control George Foreman.

1313
02:02:33.734 --> 02:02:37.903
There's been an accidental injury
to George Foreman in training.

1314
02:02:37.946 --> 02:02:39.737
The truth is...

1315
02:02:39.823 --> 02:02:41.573
George knocked his self out.

1316
02:02:42.618 --> 02:02:44.076
That's right.

1317
02:02:44.120 --> 02:02:47.205
He did three rounds, realized
he was gonna lose to Muhammad Ali...

1318
02:02:47.248 --> 02:02:48.706
and knocked his self out.

1319
02:02:49.709 --> 02:02:52.460
I predict that when the fight is set,
he might not show.

1320
02:02:52.546 --> 02:02:53.670
Oh, you bad.

1321
02:02:53.755 --> 02:02:56.714
- That's right, I'm a bad man.
- Ain't no doubt about that.

1322
02:02:56.799 --> 02:02:59.091
Yeah, but you tell George
the same thing.

1323
02:02:59.177 --> 02:03:01.094
I heard you.
I been watching you.

1324
02:03:01.179 --> 02:03:05.181
I know he's your man, I know you got
him picked, but the man is in trouble.

1325
02:03:05.267 --> 02:03:08.310
The whole world was gonna know,
but now he ain't gonna show.

1326
02:03:09.105 --> 02:03:12.273
In order to ensure that George is ready,
we are thinking of postponing...

1327
02:03:12.317 --> 02:03:15.276
from September 24 to October 30.

1328
02:03:15.360 --> 02:03:17.318
What about the concert?

1329
02:03:17.404 --> 02:03:21.865
The concert will go on as planned.
Those dates are September 20, 21 --

1330
02:03:21.951 --> 02:03:26.245
I want all the helicopters guarded,
all the private planes, private boats.

1331
02:03:26.289 --> 02:03:28.247
I'm serious.
I want the airports--

1332
02:03:28.292 --> 02:03:30.501
I want President Mobutu
and all his paratroopers--

1333
02:03:30.584 --> 02:03:33.335
All you Zaireans,
y'all be on guard too.

1334
02:03:33.421 --> 02:03:37.048
Any strange boats creeping away,
they might be taking him out.

1335
02:03:37.134 --> 02:03:38.508
Bus stations.

1336
02:03:38.594 --> 02:03:40.093
And bus stations!

1337
02:03:40.136 --> 02:03:42.094
Right.
Watch the bus stations.

1338
02:03:42.139 --> 02:03:45.599
The elephant caravans-- They might be
tying to take him out on an elephant.

1339
02:03:45.685 --> 02:03:48.102
- What'd you say?
- Hell, I ain't talking to you.

1340
02:03:48.146 --> 02:03:49.770
Hey. Hey, man.

1341
02:03:50.856 --> 02:03:53.023
Don’t you never talk
to Angelo like that.

1342
02:03:53.109 --> 02:03:56.778
Don’t you never talk to Angie
like that again.

1343
02:03:56.821 --> 02:03:58.654
Something wrong with you, man?

1344
02:04:00.283 --> 02:04:03.701
Think you callin' some shots here?
You ain't callin' nothin'.

1345
02:04:05.706 --> 02:04:08.081
They all know.

1346
02:04:08.166 --> 02:04:11.125
All them ladies out there,
they know I'm ready.

1347
02:04:11.169 --> 02:04:14.379
I see fear in the eyes
of his followers.

1348
02:04:14.465 --> 02:04:18.092
This was supposed to be the fight
that Muhammad Ali was ended.

1349
02:04:18.177 --> 02:04:22.889
Supposed to be Muhammad was gonna fall.
Supposed to be my destruction.

1350
02:04:22.974 --> 02:04:25.475
Well, they miscalculated.
They misjudged.

1351
02:04:25.559 --> 02:04:27.183
They got it wrong.

1352
02:04:50.211 --> 02:04:51.961
Hold on a second.

1353
02:04:53.214 --> 02:04:54.338
What's your name?

1354
02:04:55.842 --> 02:04:57.008
Veronica Porche.

1355
02:04:57.052 --> 02:04:59.010
Porche. Like the sports car.

1356
02:04:59.054 --> 02:05:02.013
- Yes.
- With just a little something extra.

1357
02:05:02.056 --> 02:05:03.555
Hey, you with Don?

1358
02:05:04.642 --> 02:05:08.436
Don brought me here,
but I'm not with anybody, no.

1359
02:05:08.522 --> 02:05:10.897
- Where you come from?
- LA.

1360
02:05:10.982 --> 02:05:13.316
- LA?
- But my people are from Louisiana.

1361
02:05:13.402 --> 02:05:14.734
Louisiana.

1362
02:05:14.820 --> 02:05:16.778
What, you Creole?

1363
02:05:16.864 --> 02:05:21.909
We're Creole,
so I'm African, French and Spanish.

1364
02:05:21.994 --> 02:05:24.036
My mother's grandfather was Jewish.

1365
02:05:24.747 --> 02:05:28.040
Well, they mixed all that stuff up
in there real nice.

1366
02:05:28.083 --> 02:05:30.959
I'm the only witch doctor here.
Bundini Brown.

1367
02:05:31.045 --> 02:05:33.254
Bundini Brown
is an authentic witch doctor.

1368
02:05:33.340 --> 02:05:36.258
- You tell 'em.
- The only one in the United States.

1369
02:05:37.885 --> 02:05:41.262
I'm real glad
you said what you did.

1370
02:05:41.306 --> 02:05:44.599
You made sure the fight stays here.

1371
02:05:47.771 --> 02:05:50.856
You know all them reporters
and writers in there...

1372
02:05:52.151 --> 02:05:54.610
they say George
is gonna kill me.

1373
02:05:55.695 --> 02:05:57.069
What you think?

1374
02:06:01.119 --> 02:06:03.119
Mr. Ali? Mr. Ali?

1375
02:06:03.204 --> 02:06:05.287
- We want thank you.
- Hey, fella.

1376
02:06:05.373 --> 02:06:07.248
Y'all wanna thank me?

1377
02:06:08.460 --> 02:06:10.627
Y'all gonna thank me?
What I did?

1378
02:06:13.631 --> 02:06:16.132
They thanking me for something.

1379
02:06:16.218 --> 02:06:20.471
Hey, you ever been down to Hong Kong?
Thailand? Taiwan?

1380
02:06:20.556 --> 02:06:23.474
- No.
- No? I can't go there.

1381
02:06:24.143 --> 02:06:27.603
- Hi, Ruthie. How are you?
- Hi, champ.

1382
02:06:30.273 --> 02:06:32.231
What's going on?
I'm great. How you feeling?

1383
02:06:32.317 --> 02:06:34.651
When I go to sleep,
this closes up.

1384
02:06:35.738 --> 02:06:39.156
That's what happens. When I go
to sleep, all this rests together.

1385
02:06:39.242 --> 02:06:41.534
During the day, I got to think.

1386
02:06:41.620 --> 02:06:44.997
Get me out of this county.
All the women so pretty.

1387
02:06:45.082 --> 02:06:50.336
All of em, they got hair come all
the way down to the back of their knees.

1388
02:06:50.420 --> 02:06:54.005
All of em-- All of em
about Veronica's complexion.

1389
02:06:54.091 --> 02:06:56.466
Every single one of em.
Bad, man.

1390
02:06:58.137 --> 02:07:00.387
But ain't nothing like the sisters.

1391
02:07:01.558 --> 02:07:04.351
Ain't nothing like the sisters.

1392
02:07:08.189 --> 02:07:11.482
Come on. Why don't we go
take a ride or something?

1393
02:07:11.526 --> 02:07:13.109
Wanna come with me?

1394
02:07:22.956 --> 02:07:26.499
Ruth, tell us the truth.
Is this your kind of guy?

1395
02:07:27.209 --> 02:07:28.875
More cushion for the pushin'.

1396
02:07:32.173 --> 02:07:33.380
What'd he say?

1397
02:07:34.717 --> 02:07:36.717
So why you so glad
we still here?

1398
02:07:40.474 --> 02:07:43.892
Making the fight stay here
in Africa--

1399
02:07:45.562 --> 02:07:49.231
Anybody can fight in Vegas.

1400
02:07:55.114 --> 02:07:57.573
Well, that's one job.
I got two.

1401
02:07:57.617 --> 02:07:59.575
Got to whup George.

1402
02:08:07.752 --> 02:08:09.877
Islamic faith help you do that?

1403
02:08:11.172 --> 02:08:14.924
Listen, girl, as a Muslim
I am failed in the eyes of God.

1404
02:08:14.968 --> 02:08:19.262
I should've discovered Islam at 50,
'cause I'm weak on women.

1405
02:08:20.515 --> 02:08:22.682
First they take my eyes.

1406
02:08:22.768 --> 02:08:25.227
My heart follow.

1407
02:08:25.271 --> 02:08:27.438
Making me the lovingest husband
in the world...

1408
02:08:27.522 --> 02:08:30.440
and the most terriblest husband
at the same time.

1409
02:08:33.071 --> 02:08:34.779
Look at you.

1410
02:08:34.823 --> 02:08:37.198
Green eyes.

1411
02:08:37.282 --> 02:08:39.073
Cocoa skin.

1412
02:08:40.161 --> 02:08:42.453
Okay, rest of me, let's go.

1413
02:08:50.422 --> 02:08:51.504
Rumble, Ali.

1414
02:09:35.302 --> 02:09:37.636
- Mrs. Ali.
- Hello, Muhammad, Mr. Cosell.

1415
02:09:37.680 --> 02:09:40.514
- Hey, when you get in?
- Today.

1416
02:09:40.600 --> 02:09:44.018
And I learned we now have this suite
at the intercontinental Hotel.

1417
02:09:45.522 --> 02:09:47.897
Muhammad, may I have
a word with you, please?

1418
02:09:47.982 --> 02:09:49.398
Yeah.

1419
02:09:58.327 --> 02:09:59.576
What's goin' on?

1420
02:09:59.661 --> 02:10:02.078
What do you mean,
what's goin' on?

1421
02:10:02.165 --> 02:10:04.624
Do you have to throw it
in my face?

1422
02:10:04.709 --> 02:10:08.294
Do I have to read about it? Do people
have to call me on the phone to tell me?

1423
02:10:08.378 --> 02:10:10.295
I didn't mean for that
to come out.

1424
02:10:10.381 --> 02:10:14.133
And I live with the casual ones.
I live with 'em.

1425
02:10:14.218 --> 02:10:17.052
So why do you
disrespect me like this?

1426
02:10:17.138 --> 02:10:20.765
I respect you.
I will always respect you.

1427
02:10:30.569 --> 02:10:32.193
Do you love her?

1428
02:10:37.744 --> 02:10:39.202
I don't know.

1429
02:10:45.960 --> 02:10:48.544
So what is supposed to happen now?

1430
02:10:50.381 --> 02:10:52.298
I fight George.

1431
02:10:53.885 --> 02:10:56.552
I didn't come all this far to lose.

1432
02:10:59.223 --> 02:11:00.639
Neither did l.

1433
02:11:26.920 --> 02:11:28.336
Belinda.

1434
02:11:32.802 --> 02:11:34.218
What, Bingham?

1435
02:15:09.528 --> 02:15:10.777
There it is.

1436
02:15:24.754 --> 02:15:27.129
Hey, Zack, where's George?

1437
02:15:27.215 --> 02:15:28.673
What's he pulling?

1438
02:15:28.715 --> 02:15:30.590
Where's George?
Where'd he go?

1439
02:15:31.677 --> 02:15:34.928
I just wanna make sure
you're gonna control the evening.

1440
02:15:35.682 --> 02:15:38.600
George is jerking us off,
making us wait.

1441
02:17:16.996 --> 02:17:20.706
It's all over for you, man.
You don't have a chance.

1442
02:17:21.835 --> 02:17:23.835
You don't have no chance.

1443
02:17:23.920 --> 02:17:25.962
The rumble in the jungle!

1444
02:17:26.048 --> 02:17:28.131
You don't have no chance, man.

1445
02:17:28.217 --> 02:17:29.299
Okay, let's go.

1446
02:17:30.053 --> 02:17:32.720
You guys know the rules.
I want a good, clean fight.

1447
02:17:32.804 --> 02:17:35.346
Ali, be quiet
and listen to the instructions.

1448
02:17:35.432 --> 02:17:37.432
You been hearing about me
ever since you was a boy.

1449
02:17:37.518 --> 02:17:39.935
Ali, be quiet.
Listen to the instructions.

1450
02:17:40.021 --> 02:17:42.271
- Now you got to face me.
- No hitting low.

1451
02:17:42.356 --> 02:17:44.773
- When I tell you to break--
- You got to face me now.

1452
02:17:44.859 --> 02:17:46.817
Be quiet,
or I'll disqualify you.

1453
02:17:46.904 --> 02:17:49.863
When I tell you to break,
I want a clean break. Understand?

1454
02:17:49.907 --> 02:17:53.492
- You shoulda never came to Africa.
- All right, shake hands.

1455
02:17:53.576 --> 02:17:55.534
Take your corners.

1456
02:17:55.579 --> 02:17:57.662
Okay. All right.
No problem.

1457
02:18:41.461 --> 02:18:42.919
Break!

1458
02:18:52.598 --> 02:18:54.723
All right, break. Step back.

1459
02:19:26.299 --> 02:19:29.217
Take it to him!
That's what we came to do, Daddy!

1460
02:19:41.106 --> 02:19:43.064
The heavyweight championship fight...

1461
02:19:43.150 --> 02:19:45.776
- That's all you got?
- live via satellite...

1462
02:19:45.820 --> 02:19:47.778
direct from Zaire, Africa.

1463
02:19:50.283 --> 02:19:53.201
- There we go.
- That's it, Daddy.

1464
02:19:53.287 --> 02:19:55.996
You just keep dancing
around him, okay?

1465
02:19:56.831 --> 02:19:58.455
Just keep moving.

1466
02:20:06.174 --> 02:20:08.007
Legs hurting.

1467
02:20:09.095 --> 02:20:10.553
Air heavy...

1468
02:20:10.638 --> 02:20:12.638
like I'm in water.

1469
02:20:33.578 --> 02:20:35.578
Get away from the rope!

1470
02:20:37.166 --> 02:20:40.167
Get off the rope!
Get off there! Move it!

1471
02:20:42.546 --> 02:20:45.255
Get off there! Get off there!

1472
02:20:53.766 --> 02:20:55.683
Get off the rope!

1473
02:20:59.773 --> 02:21:01.022
Get off them ropes!

1474
02:21:01.900 --> 02:21:05.861
Come on now, Ali,
get off the ropes!

1475
02:21:05.905 --> 02:21:07.363
Come on, baby!

1476
02:21:08.448 --> 02:21:10.281
Come on, Ali!

1477
02:21:12.119 --> 02:21:15.078
That's it?
That's all you got? That's it?

1478
02:21:20.795 --> 02:21:23.212
Move him out to the center!

1479
02:21:23.257 --> 02:21:24.881
There he goes!

1480
02:21:26.884 --> 02:21:30.219
Get away from the ropes!
Get off the ropes!

1481
02:22:03.881 --> 02:22:06.465
Been here before.

1482
02:22:06.551 --> 02:22:08.551
Little greenroom.

1483
02:22:08.637 --> 02:22:11.179
Open that door.
Gonna get out this place.

1484
02:22:11.264 --> 02:22:13.848
Come on, man,
get up and get out.

1485
02:22:29.117 --> 02:22:31.951
They said you could punch, George.

1486
02:22:31.995 --> 02:22:34.704
You ain't hittin'.
You hittin' like a sissy, George.

1487
02:22:36.334 --> 02:22:38.584
You can't lay up on the ropes
like that.

1488
02:22:39.627 --> 02:22:44.005
You're letting him beat on you.
You can't do that, champ. Come on, now.

1489
02:22:44.049 --> 02:22:47.801
-You wanna explain that to me?
-Jab, then go to the middle of the ring.

1490
02:22:47.845 --> 02:22:51.222
- You had your fight going, then--
- You gotta dance, baby.

1491
02:22:51.307 --> 02:22:54.684
Shut up! Just be quiet!
You let me take care of this!

1492
02:22:54.728 --> 02:22:57.979
Got to dance.
You can't come out there like that.

1493
02:22:58.022 --> 02:22:59.980
- You can't back up.
- You got to respect the man.

1494
02:23:00.024 --> 02:23:03.943
What is with the ropes? Something
going on you wanna talk to me about?

1495
02:23:04.029 --> 02:23:06.988
Tell me what's going on with you.
What are you doing?

1496
02:23:07.074 --> 02:23:10.868
Put the jab on him.
You got to let him go and dance.

1497
02:23:10.912 --> 02:23:14.455
Don't let him get in your corner.
He's tying to cut the ring off you.

1498
02:23:14.539 --> 02:23:18.375
He's tying to cut you off the ring.
You can't let that happen.

1499
02:23:19.545 --> 02:23:21.795
Just take care of it!

1500
02:23:24.508 --> 02:23:27.718
And there's the bell.
The fighters meet in mid-ring.

1501
02:23:37.731 --> 02:23:39.230
Get off the ropes!

1502
02:23:39.274 --> 02:23:41.149
Stay off the ropes!

1503
02:23:42.861 --> 02:23:46.196
Foreman again
pushing him against the ropes.

1504
02:23:46.240 --> 02:23:50.701
And Ali laying back, fighting those
blows against the sides of his body.

1505
02:23:50.744 --> 02:23:53.370
Get back in the middle
of the ring, Ali!

1506
02:23:54.415 --> 02:23:56.707
Muhammad, get off the ropes!

1507
02:24:28.784 --> 02:24:32.411
You're punching like a sissy, George.
Punching like a sissy.

1508
02:24:44.592 --> 02:24:46.759
What the hell's going on?
Come on.

1509
02:24:58.817 --> 02:25:02.444
George, get him back.
What the hell's going on? Come on.

1510
02:25:14.541 --> 02:25:17.292
You got to get off the ropes!

1511
02:25:17.336 --> 02:25:18.919
Get off the ropes!

1512
02:25:19.003 --> 02:25:21.921
Eight rounds to go.
Running out of gas, big fella?

1513
02:25:23.091 --> 02:25:24.507
Let him go.

1514
02:25:37.481 --> 02:25:41.400
Can't let you get that second wind which
you don't even know is there for you.

1515
02:25:41.486 --> 02:25:44.654
You want the title?
Want to wear the heavyweight crown?

1516
02:25:44.698 --> 02:25:47.866
Nose broke, jaw smashed,
face busted in.

1517
02:25:47.951 --> 02:25:49.868
You ready for that?
Is that you?

1518
02:25:49.954 --> 02:25:53.372
'Cause you facing a man who will die
before he lets you win.

1519
02:26:05.720 --> 02:26:08.638
Ali, don't let him beat on you
on the inside.

1520
02:26:09.766 --> 02:26:11.724
Don't let him beat on you
on the inside.

1521
02:26:20.402 --> 02:26:21.734
Come on, Ali.

1522
02:26:23.739 --> 02:26:25.948
Let's go, Ali.

1523
02:26:26.033 --> 02:26:29.243
Let's go, baby!
Stay off the ropes!

1524
02:26:29.287 --> 02:26:30.619
Get off the ropes!

1525
02:26:30.704 --> 02:26:32.996
There it is.
Keep 'em in his face.

1526
02:26:34.625 --> 02:26:35.624
Break!

1527
02:26:35.710 --> 02:26:37.835
Oh, you missed him, George!

1528
02:26:37.921 --> 02:26:40.046
You gotta go to work on him, Ali!

1529
02:26:48.597 --> 02:26:51.556
I thought you could punch, George.
They said you could punch.

1530
02:26:51.601 --> 02:26:53.059
Come on, Ali!

1531
02:26:54.271 --> 02:26:57.022
Get away from the rope!
Get off the rope!

1532
02:26:57.108 --> 02:26:58.524
He got him!

1533
02:27:05.033 --> 02:27:06.950
Move him around! Take him!

1534
02:27:08.160 --> 02:27:09.618
Come on, Ali!

1535
02:27:16.669 --> 02:27:19.879
Get off the ropes!
Get off the ropes!

1536
02:27:21.050 --> 02:27:22.424
Get off the ropes!

1537
02:28:07.515 --> 02:28:10.474
George Foreman is hit
by a combination of punches...

1538
02:28:10.518 --> 02:28:12.017
and down he goes!

1539
02:28:12.061 --> 02:28:13.811
George Foreman is down!

1540
02:28:13.855 --> 02:28:16.940
He's fallen
like a tree in the forest!

1541
02:28:17.026 --> 02:28:20.361
He is felled by a combination of blows
from Muhammad Ali!

1542
02:28:38.505 --> 02:28:41.715
Okay, this fight's over!
This fight's over!

1543
02:28:54.105 --> 02:28:56.689
I told you! I told you!

1544
02:29:06.619 --> 02:29:10.162
Referee Zack Clayton is counting.
Seven, eight!

1545
02:29:10.248 --> 02:29:12.206
And he's on his knee.
It is over!

1546
02:29:12.290 --> 02:29:14.332
It is over! It is over!

1547
02:29:14.418 --> 02:29:15.876
It is over!

1548
02:29:15.920 --> 02:29:19.964
George Foreman has been knocked out
by Muhammad Ali!

1549
02:29:20.050 --> 02:29:22.551
Muhammad Ali
has done the impossible!

1550
02:29:22.594 --> 02:29:25.011
He has regained
the heavyweight crown...

1551
02:29:25.097 --> 02:29:29.558
that was taken unjustly
from him in 1967.

1552
02:29:32.437 --> 02:29:35.063
What a moment of history
in this arena...

1553
02:29:35.149 --> 02:29:37.608
in Zaire, Africa!

1554
02:29:47.580 --> 02:29:50.081
A tremendous, tremendous moment.
